# OPEN HOUSE: a save from before the owner's two guests (the second layout,
# where the stock bought had 46 guests) is carried over: the lists won, the
# streak, OPEN ALL NIGHT's bests and the run in progress.
game openhouse
wait 5
cheat new 3 1
cheat pop 10
cheat shop 5
expect bought5 == 1
expect cards == 11
cheat door 0 1
expect n == 2
cheat oldsave2 5
reload
game openhouse
wait 30
expect won == 5
expect streak == 1
expect best_streak == 4
expect has_run == 1
expect nbest2 == 3
press A
wait 5
press A
wait 5
expect state == 5
expect scen == 3
expect players == 1
expect n == 2
expect night == 1
expect npool == 15
expect bought5 == 1
expect cards == 11
expect pop == 6
expect jinx == 0
